  reason: "The producer arm for the derived-node-identity step-2 instrument (gunbc.target_binding GenericIdentityCensusProducer). Its host part is transport only: read the fixture file and the v2.compiler.compile closure's sources from disk, hand each to v1.tests.claim.generic_identity_census as SourceFile data, and relay the returned text. The standing line, every control, the report's counts and the unobserved populations are all decided by that .dag module; the host maps the first line of the returned standing to a termination and adds no verdict. It sits in the host because compile_to_resolved over an authored source vector does not run under the interpreter (the same boundary v1.tests.claim.carrier_realization_census records for its own driver).",

